        "original_id": "fcc41cd5-59d8-5271-a861-88c78ed8a72b",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Organizations: Baylor Bears football team, Baylor University\n- Places: McLane Stadium, Waco, Texas\n- People: Drayton McLane Jr.\n- Events: 2014 Baylor Bears football season, stadium naming change\n\nFacts:\n- In 2014, the Baylor Bears football team played its 116th football season.\n- In 2014, the Baylor Bears football team played its first season in the new McLane Stadium in Waco, Texas.\n- In December 2013, Baylor Stadium was renamed McLane Stadium.\n- In December 2013, McLane Stadium was named in honor of Baylor alumnus and business magnate Drayton McLane Jr.\n- Drayton McLane Jr. provided the lead gift for the construction of McLane Stadium.",
